  "description": "Subject: Want to see what today’s rates mean for you? | Preheader: Compare current options using your own loan details.",
  "type": "email",
  "builder": "mailpurse",
  "html_content": "<!doctype html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>Want to see what today’s rates mean for you?</title></head><body style=\"margin:0;background:#f1f4f8;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><div style=\"display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;mso-hide:all\">Compare current options using your own loan details.</div><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background:#f1f4f8\"><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:24px 12px\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"600\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:600px;background:#fff\"><tr><td style=\"padding:24px 30px;border-top:5px solid #0BFF56\"><a href=\"https://www.gorealo.com/\"><img src=\"https://app.gorealo.org/email-template-previews/gorealo/gorealo-logo.png\" width=\"154\" alt=\"GoRealo\" style=\"display:block;width:154px;max-width:100%;height:auto;border:0\"></a><p style=\"margin:9px 0 0;color:#667085;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:1.5px\">MORTGAGE OPTIONS, MADE CLEAR</p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:30px;background:#f0f5ff\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 12px;color:#003FDA;font-size:11px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:2px\">A QUICK RATE CHECK</p><h1 style=\"font-size:30px;line-height:1.2;margin:0 0 16px;color:#162849\">A rate is only useful when it fits your picture.</h1><p style=\"font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#374151;margin:0 0 14px\">Hi {{first_name}}, mortgage rates can change, and the advertised number may not match your situation. Compare the rate, APR, points, fees, and estimated payment together.</p><p style=\"font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#162849;font-weight:bold;margin:0\">Are you comparing a purchase or a refinance?</p><p style=\"margin:20px 0 0\"><img src=\"https://app.gorealo.org/email-template-previews/gorealo/assets/loan-savings-math.png\" alt=\"GoRealo: Mortgage rates\" width=\"540\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:540px;height:auto;border:0;border-radius:8px\"></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:22px 30px\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"><tr><td style=\"padding:14px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e5eaf1\"><h2 style=\"font-size:17px;line-height:1.35;margin:0 0 7px;color:#162849\">Make it a fair comparison</h2><p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:#4b5563;margin:0\">Loan type, term, credit profile, down payment, property, and points can all affect pricing.</p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:14px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e5eaf1\"><h2 style=\"font-size:17px;line-height:1.35;margin:0 0 7px;color:#162849\">Look at APR and costs too</h2><p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:#4b5563;margin:0\">A lower note rate may come with different upfront costs. Review the full offer before deciding.</p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:14px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e5eaf1\"><h2 style=\"font-size:17px;line-height:1.35;margin:0 0 7px;color:#162849\">See live options</h2><p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:#4b5563;margin:0\">Use the current rate page to compare programs and terms. Rates can change without notice and are not a commitment to lend.</p></td></tr></table><p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:#374151;margin:22px 0\">Reply with purchase or refinance and your state. We’ll help you find a relevant starting point.</p><p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:#374151\">Warmly,<br><strong>The GoRealo Team</strong></p><table role=\"presentation\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"margin:22px 0\"><tr><td bgcolor=\"#003FDA\" style=\"border-radius:4px\"><a href=\"https://www.gorealo.com/mortgage-rates/\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:14px 24px;color:#fff;text-decoration:none;font-size:15px;font-weight:bold\">Compare current rates</a></td></tr></table><p style=\"font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;color:#667085\">Prefer to talk? Call <a href=\"tel:+18667139292\" style=\"color:#003FDA\">1-866-713-9292</a> or reply to this email.</p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:20px 30px;background:#f4f6f9\"><p style=\"font-size:11px;line-height:1.7;color:#667085;margin:0\">GoRealo® is a DBA of Consumer Credit Services, LLC. NMLS #1070755 · Florida Mortgage Broker License #MBR1434.<br>5011 Gate Parkway Bldg 100, Suite 100, Jacksonville, FL 32256.<br>Equal Housing Opportunity. Credit, collateral, eligibility, and program terms apply.</p><p style=\"font-size:11px;line-height:1.7;color:#667085\"><a href=\"https://www.gorealo.com/privacy-policy/\" style=\"color:#003FDA\">Privacy</a> · <a href=\"{{unsubscribe_url}}\" style=\"color:#003FDA\">Unsubscribe</a></p></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></body></html>",
  "plain_text_content": "Want to see what today’s rates mean for you? Compare current options using your own loan details. MORTGAGE OPTIONS, MADE CLEAR A QUICK RATE CHECK A rate is only useful when it fits your picture. Hi {{first_name}}, mortgage rates can change, and the advertised number may not match your situation. Compare the rate, APR, points, fees, and estimated payment together. Are you comparing a purchase or a refinance? Make it a fair comparison Loan type, term, credit profile, down payment, property, and points can all affect pricing. Look at APR and costs too A lower note rate may come with different upfront costs. Review the full offer before deciding. See live options Use the current rate page to compare programs and terms. Rates can change without notice and are not a commitment to lend. Reply with purchase or refinance and your state. We’ll help you find a relevant starting point. Warmly, The GoRealo Team Compare current rates Prefer to talk? Call 1-866-713-9292 or reply to this email. GoRealo® is a DBA of Consumer Credit Services, LLC. NMLS #1070755 · Florida Mortgage Broker License #MBR1434. 5011 Gate Parkway Bldg 100, Suite 100, Jacksonville, FL 32256. Equal Housing Opportunity. Credit, collateral, eligibility, and program terms apply. Privacy · Unsubscribe",
